 /*
- * DMAC triggers pulsed by their peripheral: a TC's overflow (DMAC_ID_OVF)
- * goes to DMAC input "trigger"[id]; the DMAC tells the TC whether a
- * channel waits for it, so that the TC only then runs to every overflow
+ * DMAC triggers pulsed by their peripheral: a TC's or TCC's overflow
+ * (DMAC_ID_OVF, line "ovf-dma") and a TCC's channels (DMAC_ID_MCn,
+ * "mc-dma"[n]) go to DMAC input "trigger"[id]; the DMAC tells the
+ * peripheral whether a channel waits for it ("...-dma-wanted"), so that
+ * it only then runs through every event
  */
